// The dense term is the in-order content span inside the sketch.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE span ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE law  ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG span law

IMPULSE span 1
IMPULSE law 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY law
DECIDE law
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "span" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
